%% Permission-aware report and order export flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Tenant admin
    participant Web as Admin dashboard
    participant API as Reports API
    participant Guard as Permission and membership guards
    participant Report as ReportsService
    participant DB as Tenant PostgreSQL
    participant CSV as CSV projection/stream
    participant Audit as Audit and metrics

    Admin->>Web: Select date range, filters, and report
    Web->>API: GET bounded report or orders export
    API->>Guard: Validate tenant membership and reports permission
    Guard->>Report: Continue with actor permission set
    Report->>Report: Normalize UTC period and allowed filters
    Report->>DB: Read tenant-local orders in bounded keyset pages
    DB-->>Report: Bounded page of rows
    loop Until keyset exhausted
        Report->>DB: Read next page after last stable key
        DB-->>Report: Next bounded page
    end
    Report->>Report: Project fields permitted for actor
    Report->>Report: Sum money using integer minor units
    Report->>CSV: Escape formula-like cells and stream output
    CSV-->>Web: Report or downloadable export
    Report->>Audit: Record export metadata without sensitive payload

    Note over Guard,Report: Frontend-hidden fields remain protected by backend projection.
    Note over Report,DB: Tenant database is resolved before any order/customer read.
    Note over Report,CSV: Keyset pages and bounded date ranges prevent unbounded memory growth.
